            "id": "s1:p1",
            "text": "Eupatorium lindleyanum is a herbaceous perennial plant in the family Asteraceae native from China, Japan, Korea and Siberia. There are at least two varieties including:\n Eupatorium lindleyanum var. lindleyanum\n Eupatorium lindleyanum var. eglandulosum"
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p2",
            "text": "Description\nEupatorium lindleyanum is a herbaceous perennial growing from 30 to 150 cm tall from a short rhizome."
